  <item>
    <title>Vol.38 拉萨河女神，还有秃鹫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a83d0cd8156bf33621a004a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a83d0cd8156bf33621a004a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 03:59:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！本期Momo和Ethan继续和大家分享关于西藏的文学阅读与旅行体验~</span></p><p><span>西藏瑰丽的自然风光和独特的风土人情，是文学肥沃的温床，让先锋文学肆意地生长，以及Ethan这次心怀敬畏，看到了马原小说中的人物无缘得见的天葬，心中说不尽的怅惘。</span></p><p><span>西藏之旅净化心灵的同时，让Ethan感悟最深的还是要拥有一个好身体，希望屏幕前的家人们，都能拥有一个好身体，才能愉快玩耍！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">00:01:26</a> 先锋文学，先从马原开始，见证冈底斯的诱惑，以及拉萨河女神</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">00:13:01</a> 再谈“城堡”中的马原</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">00:18:20</a> 白度母、绿度母，扎西达娃的两滴泪，还有一尊无性别的神</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">00:22:43</a> 万玛才旦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">00:25:43</a> 终于抵达圣湖羊卓雍错</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">00:27:45</a> 一僧一寺与……1314？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">00:33:16</a> 纳木错和念青唐古拉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">00:37:35</a> 琼穆岗嘎！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">00:46:43</a> 藏獒和拉布拉多，牦牛与青稞饼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3645">01:00:45</a> 天·葬</span></p><p><span>很遗憾地得知，最近直贡梯寺据说已经拒绝游客再参加仪式了，应该是有人不遵守规则，不尊重传统，希望大家还能够敬畏历史，敬畏他人，敬畏生命。</span></p><p><span>最后，还是希望大家能够身体健康，让我们下期再见！</span></p><blockquote><p><span>本期涉及的文学作品：《冈底斯的诱惑》《拉萨河女神》《虚构》《妻妾成群》《系在皮绳扣上的魂》《无性别的神》《撞死了一只羊》《气球》</span></p></blockquote><p><span>    </span></p><p><span>   </span></p><p><span>  </span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/ljPGrEnKxnKimsYLfsIurLAEirf6.m4a" length="85234358" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:27:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftz7LACDVtXHzsoujXRJZw0wvzrB.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.37 到拉萨去，到远方去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a671348a3fec224d5a415ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a671348a3fec224d5a415ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 08:38:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>某种程度上，想象西藏，就是在想象远方。</span></p><p><span>遥远的拉萨，巍峨的布达拉……这些曾存在于幻想中的场景，浮现在眼前的时刻，历史与现实、文本与世界……甚至于一种玄妙的声响就回荡于耳畔。</span></p><p><span>借由ETHAN在拉萨偶然的奇妙之旅，MOMO与ETHAN重温童年幻梦，也谈论现在，勇敢想象未来：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:00:46</a> 缘起：莲花</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">00:08:54</a> 胜境与秘境：亚丁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">00:18:50</a> 《尘埃落定》与藏族经验以及想象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">00:29:50</a> 回拉萨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">00:37:31</a> 布达拉宫双线的镇馆之宝</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2ZwFjdtC_YX4QjIFwjJr-kH88R.jpg"><h2><span>（夜幕中的布拉达）</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">00:39:42</a> 磕长头的终点：大昭寺</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsmALuCj-6zdXV71Z31KrluYrmxp.jpg"><h2><span>（大昭寺中漫长的转经筒之路）</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">00:42:36</a> 大小昭寺与两位公主的秘闻</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuXYi6h6LzrUOEatXH-QpKqjxAnS.jpg"><h2><span>（大昭寺辩经）</span></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnXEkNrGUTmxNwVvYN-ndCVFH2D3.jpg"><h2><span>（罗布林卡一隅）</span></h2><blockquote><p><span>本集涉及到的文艺作品：</span></p><p><span>安妮宝贝：《莲花》</span></p><p><span>《18X：18岁前不能去的18个地方》</span></p><p><span>《双城记：从台北到北京》</span></p><p><span>刘子超：《失落的卫星》《血与蜜之地》</span></p><p><span>阿来：《尘埃落定》</span></p><p><span>纪录片《第三极》</span></p></blockquote><p></p><p><span>下一期，让我们一同走进拉萨更深处，走近妖冶神秘的拉萨河女神……</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>     </span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lrdqhpv_-0h3yvbrmSeGYXo7-DSH.m4a" length="47970471" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvciv338xs8shPCd6YK0TMnJXMS4.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.36 《流俗地》下｜五彩缤纷的气球，以及废墟</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1871d57460cabdeb577969</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1871d57460cabdeb577969</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在银霞目不见物和听的风景之中，让我们接着聊《流俗地》，说说银霞这个女孩的痛苦与悸动，说说马票嫂热热闹闹的生活，也说说我们当下马来西亚的旅行体验，说说我们对文化多元与融合的理解与感受……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">00:01:13</a> 为什么是盲人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">00:11:30</a> 马票、马票嫂、《大伯公千字图》与马华的地方志</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">00:15:18</a> 槟城的拜天公，台湾的哪吒庙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">00:38:01</a> Momo力荐美食：Nasi Lemak </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">00:41:53</a> 文化融合：更多元了？还是更美国了？ </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">00:47:58</a> 文化杂交（hybridity）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a> 从《野菩萨》到《流俗地》：先锋转向现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">01:03:02</a> 语言：鸽子，然后是鹰这样的巨鸟，却只是“一种轻微的抽搐”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4004">01:06:44</a> 细辉说经济上行时期，就像“五彩缤纷的气球”</span></p><p><span>在我们录制这期节目的时候，正是黎紫书发表《一个陌生女人的来信》这篇小说对当代作家抄袭问题表达看法的时候，待到节目播出的现在，她又与“抒情的森林”就抄袭问题有了不同的看法，事件变化太快，Ethan和Momo有点跟不上了，只能先做旅行青蛙，给家人们分享一些照片～</span></p><p><span>拜天公：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ntsTMFSnM1hZi2hCVP2bXgZ2zk2e.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmIVYRfP-QsGQl0NIw8Ld5dydgR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnGTFa6SCIcUC32p0biyTJ1juI-j.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nvkzG8Aiv0x-xBtM_V1RTBBQ2-Yo.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsFv2SBqnY573-VdbW0VXKlXuWjE.jpg"><p><span>让我们下期再见！ </span></p><p></p><p><span>  </span></p><p></p><p><span>  </span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/linyGHxucSMnPbKdr9F8jK8me5OI.m4a" length="65982577" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frx3HV5EGuzpxhktpKRGjNKtAX8l.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.35 《流俗地》上｜目盲见城 俗世生光</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e10287b977fb2c4723099a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e10287b977fb2c4723099a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>马来西亚🇲🇾的怡保，一座历史悠久的华人之城，目不见物的盲女银霞要怎么记住这座城的历史？要怎么把自己也写进这座城之中？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们一起走进黎紫书的《流俗地》，看看晦暗的楼上楼之中，如何生出微弱的光亮？听听纷乱的世界里，银霞坚定有力的心声。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 又见马华文学，初遇黎紫书：“吾若不写，无人能写”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> “锡都”怡保：《家园何处是》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 楼上楼群像……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a> 谁是楼上楼：麦浚龙《僵尸》与鬼与猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> 少年成长心事与三角结构：银霞、细辉与拉祖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2946">49:06</a> you assume I cannot drink </span><strong><span>Margarita</span></strong><span> so you don't give me </span><strong><span>Margarita</span></strong><span> so I won't drink </span><strong><span>Margarita.</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>涉及文本：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>王赓武：《家园何处是》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>李安：《色·戒》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>巴尔扎克：《人间喜剧》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麦浚龙：《僵尸》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>感谢大家耐心地倾听我们两人的感受，流俗未完，让我们下期再见~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lrmDfGGOB_yMw6BSlmLPvP1t4fWd.m4a" length="54951973" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgdLE_su4LdjA2_xrVwP4eS_xRdR.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.34 吃吃喝喝与其他-圣诞节欧洲漫游·终篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c983a8b977fb2c478f8f55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c983a8b977fb2c478f8f55</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>家人们！好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为主播Ethan马上要交自己可怕的博士论文了，没法帮Momo分担，她最近工作也很忙，让我们拖延了好久才来到“美食”这欧洲的最后一站（跪下道歉🧎🏻）</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们两个在回味欧洲的美食之旅的时候，两个人都不约而同地从眼睛和嘴巴都流出了泪水，味蕾的记忆可能是最令人难以忘记的回忆了（我们两个爱吃家o(╥﹏╥)o）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 法餐：“三件套”、生蚝还有传闻中的fine dining</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 回到西班牙：著名的铁锅饭、tapas还有猪猪火腿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> 在塞维利亚，不要吃街上的苦橙，但可以尝尝橙子酒~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> 鸟味的“鹧鸪” 到底是什么味道？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 西班牙油条和西班牙巴斯克芝士蛋糕，送给甜食脑袋们~（其实没有很甜）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> 吃过主食之后，小心“俄罗斯沙拉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 西班牙年夜饭要吃12颗葡萄🍇为什么？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtX08Mv1j3M0trbHMGyh7P2Ruspw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 来吃吃德国酸菜猪肘子，配上慕尼黑啤酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 不要学习茜茜公主的护肤法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 聊点趣事一：如果你在酒店中看到“I want to be your dog”……&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMSIs0GC6YT9jVb8DSvC2yiocUt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 聊点趣事二：如果你看到巴黎人屁股上检疫章一样的纹身……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">47:07</a> 旅行的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>家人们，下期再见~ （祝福Ethan论文顺利😭Momo工作不忙😭）让我们回到书本~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/loEyvkhINyPJjZinSPi-ZEeoGyWx.m4a" length="52135753" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkHYdAMOgJBFyJKE4pg9xshpS7yi.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.33 全世界的青蛙们联合起来-圣诞节欧洲漫游·广场篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697b5678073030367a5b52cb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697b5678073030367a5b52cb</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 13:03:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;美国著名的区域研究学者本尼迪克特·安德森有一本令人感动不已的自传《椰壳碗外的人生》，书中回顾了他自云南昆明出生后，飘泊穿梭于东、西方之间，又转徙东南亚各地，最后“退休与解放”的一生。这本书的书名来自于东南亚（或许是泰国或者印尼）的说法，当地人用半个椰壳作碗，若扣住一只青蛙，它就会一动不动，对此安德森是这样说的：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“静静地坐在椰壳下，青蛙很快就开始觉得椰壳碗圈起了整个宇宙。对这个印象的道德判断是青蛙无缘无故地心胸狭隘、迂腐守旧、深居简出和自我满足。就我而言，我在任何地方都无法久居到安定下来，有别于众所周知的青蛙。”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;对这个类似我们“井底之蛙”故事的解释，这位辗转一生的民族主义理论和区域研究学者的自况令人会心一笑又心酸感动，Ethan和Momo一直说我们是大家的“旅行青蛙”，没想到和安德森不谋而合（碰瓷了！），但我们仍然希望尽己所能，去触碰椰壳碗的外壁，做一只不那么静止的青蛙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;这一次，我们来到了欧洲的广场，作为“欧洲漫游计划”的第三弹，希望我们这两只“旅行青蛙”能够继续，或者说哪怕有一次，看一眼“椰壳碗外的人生”，毕竟安德森在自传的“跋”中如是说，这里与各位共勉：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“青蛙们只要不蜷缩在自己阴暗的椰壳碗里，它们的解放之战就不会输。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;全世界青蛙联合起来！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;（Frogs in their fight for emancipation will only lose by crouching in their murky coconut half-shells.</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;Frogs of the world unite！）”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 从卢浮宫到凯旋门：访问巴黎中轴线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmsYIdWllmW-l6aFUMMzKuz8Z14U.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 在杜乐丽花园的绿椅子上，看鸽群和大摆锤发呆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMDP4swH-mpBsmGaP-45hNsUjA-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> 路易十六在此断头的协和广场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 跨年前夜的香榭丽舍大街</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo38jmVXkgvWj3-swTn3qDU795Eg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 杜拉斯回忆中的巴士底狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> 没有“遗书”的蒙马特高地</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpjoi2mqwArUJvRiEDTaozp1HxeH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a> 红酒瓶和法兰西学院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a> 毁坏与重建中的巴黎圣母院</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVxMCiDasUoE_GZTkYOzkp90R-X.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 曲线属于上帝，而巴塞罗那属于高迪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft0p3PZ4oXpvkNxgtUCwIWrk6YiB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fionr_8wJ9M6u7fPJlbTu7nFGy5z.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCDk5jpeL-T-L5F0FCfmMW-g0yZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 在加泰罗尼亚音乐宫“世界大战”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv-38Eu7Gjn2VfRjnkiWJuogGOku.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">38:23</a> 海洋圣母圣殿的哥特风和老北京酸梅汤味道的bar</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslS7Zb6OuQIQQ7zaMj3thMbYKI7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> 弗朗明戈的故乡：安达卢西亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> “阿尔罕布拉宫的回忆”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8vx2yhBFuW9WncGSfhwPC_pdQO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr3OQX3fr2nu_rdJUfWT4YYyWRd7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2972">49:32</a> 塞维利亚主教堂：“四王抬棺”的哥伦布棺椁</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhRiZ_XtiUKs5nMI4OO2v5KADDxi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3111">51:51</a> 不知葬在圣多明各还是西班牙的哥伦布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3455">57:35</a> 格拉纳达的皇家礼拜堂：感受西班牙的“双王”历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">01:03:02</a> 背靠着墓地的柏林墙遗址</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6XAbC8bNDvN6ZkivgYoKmQMb8G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3995">01:06:35</a> 死亡地形图、柏林地下世界、查理检查哨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQ0c3IJEnkcXJwqQIcHeDhxoX6L.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（感受世纪之吻的威力！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhg3n4z0YAMwxOkonS8zwsUUIxEY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（在肯德基旁边的查理检查哨）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4382">01:13:02</a> 到底怎么样才能去柏林的酒吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>再次重申安德森的号召吧：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>“全世界青蛙联合起来！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Frogs of the world unite！”</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lqldw1mxZlC3fNQIFgSXbwObojlw.m4a" length="74077373" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtV2-5VPpNdgFehxGduDUU1bTWok.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
