  <item>
    <title>Vol.30 精神杂粮｜书在读，剧在追，我在晃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6932802d4ef12f9fe90bfa5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6932802d4ef12f9fe90bfa5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 07:05:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这种天气</span></p><p><span>谁能拒绝在家里煲煲剧 再看看书的极致诱惑呢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>《勿言推理》有多少人，就有多少真相，而事实只有一个。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 狗狗眼和大叔，你pick谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a>《3年A班》- 菅田将晖疯批演技大赏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 《短剧开始啦》&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 还用多说吗？是《重启人生》哎！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a>《热点》外星人替我捡篮球</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 金爱烂《外面是夏天》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">33:34</a> 辛波丝卡的《一见钟情》&amp; 徐志摩的《偶然》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> “文学是弱者的反抗”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 岛田庄司《占星术杀人魔法》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> 新书推荐：龚万辉《人工少女》 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 陈冲《猫鱼》</span></p><p><span>12月到了，牛姐的《All I want for Christmas Is You》已经解冻了90%</span></p><p><span>下一期呢，就让我们跟着Ethan的脚步👣 一起去欧洲过圣诞</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lkm_kYwwiPGYNf1IJFbJQa3B8BQz.m4a" length="47378976" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvs4mYP4ik4kurdd81aICBAqzFrP.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.29 精神杂粮｜下班关脑 开机上线</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6927602af8a9e1d1629b35d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6927602af8a9e1d1629b35d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 20:28:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi 书友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>姗姗来迟 好久不见❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期本来是想在秋风起的那一刻给大家带来一些温暖闲谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>结果因为现实生活过分充实而一直拖延</span></p><span></span><p><span>但还好天气还没热起来 还算应景！</span></p><span></span><p><span>还要滑跪道歉一下🙇这一期Ethan的音频设备出了点问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以听感欠佳 是"Ethan-大舌头版"</span></p><span></span><p><span>但想着录都录了 剪都剪了 话痨主播还是想和大家聊聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>为伤害到大家的耳朵提前道歉 以后尽量不出现这样的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>言归正传</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然自诩为脚趾甲盖读书博主 但也是精神性杂食动物</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以开辟这个“精神杂粮”系列栏目 聊聊书本及书本之外的文艺生活边角料</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天 就先一起宅在家里 打打游戏吧🎮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 盛世天下 “只有两个男人算什么乙游”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 你是从哪里知道“武则天”的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 橙光 - 文字冒险游戏之家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> 橙光游戏双璧 - 《潜伏之赤途》 &amp; 《棠棣之华》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> 月光蟑螂工作室 - 《烟火》 &amp; 《三伏》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 为什么非要打游戏 不直接去看电视剧呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 《飞跃十三号房》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a> 顽皮狗公司 - 《最后生还者2》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a> 《罗拉快跑》- 用电影触及游戏内核</span></p><span></span><p><span>下一期 我们拿起遥控器</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起坐沙发上煲剧的小土豆🥔</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lqROjqrmnoJ-Be0S2fdTGYNLUpB-.m4a" length="58009865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1sCpUSiMFd6nQDpmEs1i9HKVj1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.28 辣椒、塔可和龙舌兰 -墨西哥亡灵节行记 下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ed8fee224325ea7016f873</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ed8fee224325ea7016f873</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Oct 2025 00:11:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>彩墙反射午后的热浪</span></p><span></span><p><span>吉他声从街角飘出</span></p><span></span><p><span>一卷塔可🌮，一口龙舌兰🍷</span></p><span></span><p><span>墨西哥正在慢慢醒来🇲🇽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> &nbsp;Gazpacho - 墨西哥果切</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvuYNggWtxzPMzEOoOrjFqIsxLao.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> Elote - 街头烤玉米棒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1h2ZpgEyLOXp7-CZ5V6ejrEntW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 亡灵节糖果 - 椰蓉酥塔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslHDsPCTwXpM3E3svTXHebe-q4m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> Taco🌮</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loW89aZyOuEI9YAsLdR5NK5R2Pfk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpUcBiJKlRRBXoTFrIqUQxhrIYR9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> &nbsp;Tacos de disco - Taco铁板烧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhmcRwPk5q7eowH72KaIpf6FF2tl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 填陷辣椒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loaPOlJnC6flnbIyl0XonFkepTfG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> Tlayuda - 墨西哥披萨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luZdkYVPtln9S2jvTXVD4cW6nqYv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> Ethan魂牵梦萦的酸辣猪蹄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ligtX2LSRAZsoyrMK-HpwCzhw7QW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> &nbsp;阿莱布里赫 alebrije</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp969-cWsA-EStLvEBu3UR1I5jtv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln8hyRru1qFCom1wRW5qFKaDOWzp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv427_syVMcJ0848zXgsOGHwgCV-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 墨西哥“三里屯”的亡灵节装饰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll0VkUQgxMaiRsd61q8LVH51F6Yp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 莫雷利亚的街头艺术 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj3Ya3Qw3Px1Kx-bjaq5okGzUOPh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmnKtnhLAO3IwW155I6nce2ORjps.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">25:59</a> 巴斯孔塞洛斯图书馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo-0fUOyjC-o8hprxX8MohLoElrN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvCs9QEJ3yudeHpl_DqH-Gs5RaPg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lue3cnfV9FHYPepaGLFt-xsD231f.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a> 国立人类学博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmFKNiEJEtqlWpw_zftNRxtZq5oD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj2HxugLEoEtrpet3zvUY7AuyHoc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 墨西哥金字塔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhvTvO5_TeHraNwxMkeHvhrCmzTx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoSWtdT1g-cHqpXftXa0tmKOXJJ4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 墨西哥城酒吧街</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvkCHjuGV6zMrZTJe7HT58f8N9wa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkcb78YwryQoJHbVcQouT7LY3-Sn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最后 喝上这杯咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这趟 无购物 纯电子游览的旅途</span></p><span></span><p><span>有给你带来一丝丝放松和愉悦❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期见</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYYn1KEJZM69nfQW-Stm_B4QGOb.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lj6HwWSpTeoRVaveyLiPWTzNtmgk.m4a" length="58032220" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgumgFm0eQAGvEa8viaGze4iLgpz.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
