  <item>
    <title>Vol.27 寻梦环游记 - 墨西哥亡灵节行记 中</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c7507b2c82c9dcca5abf69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c7507b2c82c9dcca5abf69</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暖橙色的烛光点亮夜晚的坟茔</span></p><span></span><p><span>盛放的万寿菊听着酒杯间的低语</span></p><span></span><p><span>《寻梦环游记》是现实的倒影</span></p><span></span><p><span>而我在等待 亡灵归乡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 米却肯州湖区亡灵节 - 最早被联合国教科文单独认定的亡灵节庆典</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> &nbsp;Tupátaro与神秘的教堂地板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> &nbsp;Cuanajo的木马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 乡村大舞台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> Coco的现实倒影：Tzurumutaro和Tzintzuntzan</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 帕茨夸罗湖（Lake Pátzcuaro）中的墓地：帕坎达岛（Isla de La Pacanda）和Janitzio（哈尼茨奥岛）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> 所思所想</span></p><span></span><p><span>亡灵节主要仪式外</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个话痨主播还有一些杂七杂八的关于食物，街头文化等见闻想和大家分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>那我们下期再见👋</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇下面请接收来自旅游牛蛙的明信片投递👇</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cuanojo镇中心的木马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlYAcbZN_Qvr4A0H6qx4Gb22z6tY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>绕满了万寿菊和祭品的家庭祭坛前的木马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpfWRearqdHFew2c16fstVb5uP1q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“乡村大舞台”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpRRi2-9svvie0_fk4AYlTiOxNW_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>随处可见的亡灵节公共装饰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpJijnIx9c3gmKGIrwiPw0HBmBPE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnz5MFDK_uCAUqVjKuCS96jmkRQV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmYXup3rir7iH1fYaT2FsEtacQAB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>守灵夜的墓园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkklkFEBrTCyQApY0KQy2N7b66Oi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVrDviwap7OTBkuDyXkF0mZ66Xi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuHVONSoF3JV4QjpY8K1Dks4Luem.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FquQ9EXbpV6bXFO5CCUtizBTiOCx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrIQ4f_z0KYWyRfEPSKe7VeSx1MN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv44oUJpT1TWEoS_hFrd2bLhqVzr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>白天的Janitzio（哈尼茨奥岛）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltwoHBSC3BfAWXsGPXGvVuHMWCBa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljiZjItN5zkZVIeNq4ph32NNgqTS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRbM8D4vzkGFb9700gxuPXPkPX7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6614e5fb48c40e2fb02b376f/lgjoL91qJ9erakVOG_9W7RdbnDIF.m4a" length="82611951" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhDIaq5rLnrNmQMM0AYTkC5itgWT.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.26 盛宴上的骷髅 - 墨西哥亡灵节行记 上</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b8bd0097178f08ee26a60a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b8bd0097178f08ee26a60a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Sep 2025 22:16:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi 你好呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然还有酷暑的余温 但总归是秋风将至</span></p><span></span><p><span>吹散了夏天的青春热烈 难免泛起了一丝温暖的感伤</span></p><span></span><p><span>这三期呢 都会是两个主播的个人私心旅行播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>在秘鲁之行后 想和大家聊聊我们去年十月底的亡灵节之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span>是个人记忆的电子存档&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>是一些旅行小Tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>也是想和大家探讨 “生离死别”这道必答题的另一种解法</span></p><span></span><p><span>那第一期呢 Pre-party 让我们现在莫雷利亚的街头一边掉书袋一边闲逛逛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 《The Skeleton at the Feast: The Day of the Dead in Mexico》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 亡灵节的起源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 莫雷利亚之前，Ethan在墨西哥城，瓜纳华托和圣米格尔的Pre-亡灵节体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 莫雷利亚的万圣夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> 和我在莫雷利亚的街头走一走&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>下一期就是正餐啦&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>亡灵节的当晚 又会有怎样的感动欢笑 光怪陆离呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇下面请接收来自旅行牛蛙的明信片投放👇</span></p><span></span><p><span>圣米格尔的粉红色教堂⛪️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbYS5OsI8Dgmj849jSUQn1VPupp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>跷脚小骷髅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszxF-r_U-tp-AIVjzCXbz_rVwJI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>圣米格尔街头的广场舞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm6RxVd_p1v1hQl0rAxpk_4dAiat.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>瓜纳华托的日与夜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4VDSZ-6xg1lgoO1t54au2eGkNU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgIBqtpfMkbM4Hz-V8cQ69KcX5vX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>莫雷利亚万圣夜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnTfJfmlL3pprY-vPRhj4LSUuyLU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvoAkbSD4Sq5DRge3Cl0vVuK0nYh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMVPxSFV9lZwJUYUfNYAiYPgyQi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>随处可见的祭坛</span></p><span></span><p><span>莫雷利亚机场祭坛：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMutAc4nJdT5xQnb93X3LgDMCFy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>旅游局祭坛：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmqk-Z8dVteE_Fut14n8wZD8itdr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>市中心公共祭坛：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FphIgZyo9hXCYjp5IN6CvBzGqVrh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrHI4pQVvb4vDlBzKDgKAMbieZnQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大学生艺术作品展：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltPhT0JiyVZUVwwGCtMuLtLHkTru.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lh5OgJHeyO1Z1_SN5hrbimaKB0yG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>为晚上的游行做准备的警车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkF5yvcG5Lcj-3HTJ2nOZZhTWF7K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>用通缉令下饭的小广场：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi777sAaiESOTDQEk6q7oBi_CxLi.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
