  <item>
    <title>Vol.25《寂寞的游戏》下｜阳光普照 寂寞难藏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6892a68146542d8c41ae6107</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6892a68146542d8c41ae6107</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Aug 2025 00:53:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi 你好呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;不知不觉 竟然已经到了八月了</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然老生常谈到掉牙 但还是忍不住俗气地说一句</span><br><span>“时间过得好快啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们节目叫“书朋戏友” 但还没和大家聊过戏剧/电影/话剧呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次 我们就接着聊聊《寂寞的游戏》和电影《阳光普照》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> “镜像”和“欲望”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 被“发明”的捉迷藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 电影《阳光普照》和 “司马光砸缸”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> 剧透警告⚠️《阳光普照》剧情介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后 希望大家都有一个可以躲藏的缸</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM - 《阳光普照》电影配乐《这样对大家都好》</span></p><span></span><p></p>]]></description>
